<title>JAPAN: Ube Industries' shares up on share buy-back plan.</title>
<headline>Ube Industries' shares up on share buy-back plan.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Ube Industries Ltd rose in early Tokyo trade on Monday, helped by the firm's share buy-back announcement last week, brokers said.</p>
<p>By 0054 GMT, the shares had climbed eight yen to 344. Turnover was 777,000 shares.</p>
